&lt;p&gt;We are seeking Manufacturing Engineer Interns for &lt;strong&gt;Summer 2027&lt;/strong&gt;! This is a paid, in-person, 12 week internship. As a Manufacturing Engineer Intern you will work on projects supporting teams designing and building aerospace structures using carbon fiber composite material systems. As an intern you will have direct exposure to engineers designing and analyzing composite structures in aerospace programs, and to technicians manufacturing those structures.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
