&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a Director of Client Sales - Consumer Health Network, you will play a critical role in accelerating growth for PatientPoint’s Consumer Health Network (CHN) across OTC and consumer health brands.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
