&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Advanced certifications in sales enablement platforms or instructional design.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Proven success scaling revenue enablement organizations within hyper-growth SaaS environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
