&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Essa vaga é um pool de talentos, então pode ser que o retorno demore um pouco a mais do que outras vagas da XP! Para outras oportunidades, acesse: &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/search/?currentJobId=3781190149&amp;amp;f_C=11794476%2C14031303%2C408965%2C2304919%2C144288%2C2540096&amp;amp;geoId=92000000&amp;amp;origin=COMPANY_PAGE_JOBS_CLUSTER_EXPANSION&amp;amp;originToLandingJobPostings=3781190149%2C3774876110%2C3775485645%2C3774191568%2C3792238908%2C3751608570%2C3780008795%2C3792241617%2C3710554234&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;Oportunidades XP Inc.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
